    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based strategy game based on poker cards. Each poker card has a specific skill mechanism. You can also devour poker cards to gain new skills, collect high-scoring cards, and defeat enemies from different time and space (even yourself)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/5ffe3ae8d32e3a54607820ec41b9af78.avif?t=1741112912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Card-based duel based on &quot;Texas Hold'em&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using poker cards as the prototype, the points of poker cards are increased based on the card type, and the cards of both sides compete by comparing points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/401ccad1a28bedb8ebe059b822e174a7.avif?t=1741112912\" width=750 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Devour evolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each poker card has skills with different mechanisms, and you can also buy poker cards to devour. Successful devouring increases the number of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/f1c188ca31e7da7e01b92956baecfc8c.avif?t=1741112912\" width=624 height=986 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Joker card relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By building different relics, you can experience more genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/014d26bb5e5e8547f8415a495e7161f4.avif?t=1741112912\" width=666 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Asynchronous duel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your opponent is not an ordinary AI, but a player from different time and space, or even yourself.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based strategy game based on poker cards. Each poker card has a specific skill mechanism. You can also devour poker cards to gain new skills, collect high-scoring cards, and defeat enemies from different time and space (even yourself)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/5ffe3ae8d32e3a54607820ec41b9af78.avif?t=1741112912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Card-based duel based on &quot;Texas Hold'em&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using poker cards as the prototype, the points of poker cards are increased based on the card type, and the cards of both sides compete by comparing points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/401ccad1a28bedb8ebe059b822e174a7.avif?t=1741112912\" width=750 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Devour evolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each poker card has skills with different mechanisms, and you can also buy poker cards to devour. Successful devouring increases the number of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/f1c188ca31e7da7e01b92956baecfc8c.avif?t=1741112912\" width=624 height=986 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Joker card relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By building different relics, you can experience more genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424400/extras/014d26bb5e5e8547f8415a495e7161f4.avif?t=1741112912\" width=666 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Asynchronous duel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your opponent is not an ordinary AI, but a player from different time and space, or even yourself.</p>",
